        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6he",
          "text": "If you were in a car accident and suffered a bulging disc injury, you may find yourself wondering,",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6hf",
          "text": " How much is a bulging disc worth in a car accident?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6hg",
          "text": " There isn’t a fixed “average” settlement for a bulging disc",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6hi",
          "text": " car accident in Denver, Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "l6hh"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6hj",
          "text": ", as each case is unique and depends on various factors, such as the injury’s severity, the crash’s circumstances, and your ability to prove fault and damages. While no two cases are identical, understanding the key aspects of these claims can help you better understand what compensation you might recover in Denver, Colorado.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "i6hl",
